# Qlementine 1.5.2 (FetchContent dep) casts a QHoverEvent to QMouseEvent
# inside TabBarEventFilter (one eventFilter branch handles Press/Release
# AND Hover with the same static_cast). Upstream undefined behavior;
# harmless in practice but UBSan flags it on every tab hover. Suppressed
# so OUR undefined-behavior reports surface in `make run-cpp-asan`.
vptr:TabBarEventFilter.hpp
